+/* M2 Collection playback profiles: these are empirical ROM read views,
+ * not a claim about the private M2 emulator's underlying hardware scheme.
+ * The GG Aleste 3 deltas compare the local Collection image (CRC 5AE64731)
+ * with the RetroAchievements playability reference (CRC 717FD9E3):
+ * https://retroachievements.org/forums/topic/24600
+ *
+ * The reference still has nine known PSG mistakes at C79A, C8A1, C8B0,
+ * C942, CA6E, CAD2, CB65, CB74 and CC06; retain the original FE bytes.
+ * At C66A both images have LD (DCBA),A, while adjacent channel branches
+ * read their status. Use LD A,(DCBA) for PSG channel 3, per:
+ * https://www.dreamcast-talk.com/forum/viewtopic.php?t=16716&start=10
+ */
